[13.340257,"o","\u001b[0m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  IKE authenticates the routers\r\n  =============================\r\n\r\n  Like a Junos security ike proposal, this group names the\r\n  control-channel algorithms. The peer will use a lab-only PSK.\r\n  unmatched bypass leaves unrelated lab traffic and SSH reachable.\r\n"]
